PLACEHOLDER - NOT THE ACTUAL BINARY

This file is a stand-in for the Antarctica ASPA135 terrain DEM (GeoTIFF).
The real binary lives in upstream as a Git LFS object (~16 MB).

Upstream reference:
  Repository : https://github.com/dipraj-debnath/ROS2_MultiUAV_3D
  Path       : aerostack_examples/02_examples_gazebo_project/project_gazebo/models/aspa135_mini3/maps/A135_Mini3Pro-DEM-UTM_gr_altfixed_ROI_gz_fx_2049.tif
  LFS OID    : c927ec92b9b0db8bbb4ad3288d3716e8c62dc84b24854548b88a30a14cd625f8 (sha-256)
  LFS bytes  : 16806419

To restore the real terrain DEM:
  git clone https://github.com/dipraj-debnath/ROS2_MultiUAV_3D /tmp/upstream
  cd /tmp/upstream && git lfs install && git lfs pull
  cp /tmp/upstream/aerostack_examples/02_examples_gazebo_project/project_gazebo/models/aspa135_mini3/maps/A135_Mini3Pro-DEM-UTM_gr_altfixed_ROI_gz_fx_2049.tif <repo>/aerostack_examples/02_examples_gazebo_project/project_gazebo/models/aspa135_mini3/maps/

After restoring, re-enable LFS tracking in .gitattributes if you intend to
re-commit it (see .gitattributes for the line to add).
